tpm 1
boot power
# boot-story: power-on with blank cards and no input. SW_ON finds no save but room for one and
# shows the copyright; TIT_DEMO plays the whole story; TITLE plays its whole logo animation,
# waits 1,800 frames at "press start" and starts the attract demo (HOW_N, not traced).
program SW_ON
program TIT_DEMO
program TITLE
